Claims users > Route 53
Route 53 > ALB: AWS weight
Route 53 > Legacy: legacy weight
ALB > Web EC2: HTTPS 8443
Web EC2 > App EC2: 8080
App EC2 > MQ EC2: 9092
App EC2 > Valkey: 6379 TLS
App EC2 --> Secrets Manager
ALB --> ALB logs
ALB --> CloudWatch
